<title>USA: Highland CUSD 5, Ill., yields 5.57 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Highland CUSD 5, Ill., yields 5.57 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it repriced $3.630 million of Highland Community Unit School District No 5 (Madison, Bond and Montgomery counties), Ill., general obligation bonds, Series 1996 with a top yield of 5.57 percent in 2016.</p>
